Cleaned up the issues found by react-doctor (score 65 to 92 before the complexity pass): split the theme widgets into smaller components (`CardHeader`, `SwatchDropdown`, `ColorInput`, `LayerSizingControls`, `NewColorGroupForm`, `BlockThemeCard`), replaced 17 `useState` calls with one draft object, guarded numeric input parsing in `BorderWidget`, stopped redefining image components on every render in the Teaser and Slider bodies, keyed lists by id, cloned the search schema without dropping functions, and made the hover reader's timer cleanup explicit. @Humanaice
